[00:00.00] 作曲 : Andrew Wells/Tobias Jesso Jr.
[00:00.00][by:土豆头_先生]
[00:04.47]Said I'm to blame
[00:04.47] 你说都是我的错  
[00:06.64]Said I was broke
[00:06.64] 说我一无是处  
[00:08.76]Tried everything
[00:08.76] 我试过所有办法  
[00:10.87]Called me a liar, liar, liar
[00:10.87] 却被你骂成骗子  
[00:13.02]Further I climbed
[00:13.02] 越是奋力往上爬  
[00:15.15]Harder I'd fall
[00:15.15] 跌得就越狠  
[00:17.23]I hit the ground
[00:17.23] 我摔在地上  
[00:19.33]Watching you fly, fly, fly
[00:19.33] 看着你越飞越高、越飞越远  
[00:22.76]Bet you'd hate to think that that was true
[00:22.76] 你大概不愿相信，那其实是真的  
[00:26.66]Told me to change or I might miss my chance
[00:26.66] 你说我要是再不改变就会错过属于我的机会  
[00:30.87]But I've got space here for someone new
[00:30.87] 可我心里还留着位置
[00:34.75]Someone who loves me for who I am
[00:34.75] 给那个能真正喜欢我本来样子的人  
[00:38.22]Sleep for hours
[00:38.22] 能一觉睡到天亮  
[00:39.90]With no regrets
[00:39.90] 没有任何遗憾  
[00:41.73]I won't lose myself
[00:41.73] 就算你不再打电话来  
[00:43.77]If you don't call again
[00:43.77] 我也不会迷失自己  
[00:45.95]I'm not keeping tabs
[00:45.95] 不再去追究  
[00:48.07]On why you left
[00:48.07] 你当初为什么离开  
[00:50.13]I just need someone
[00:50.13] 我只想找一个  
[00:52.27]Who can love me for who I am
[00:52.27] 能够爱我原本模样的人
[00:55.11]Not trying to be
[00:55.11] 我不想  
[00:57.24]All on my own
[00:57.24] 一个人硬扛  
[00:59.31]I wanna feel
[00:59.31] 我也想  
[01:01.42]Like I'm alive-live-live
[01:01.42] 感受真正的生活  
[01:03.57]You didn't leave
[01:03.57] 你不是离开了  
[01:05.65]I let you go
[01:05.65] 是我放开了你  
[01:07.72]Oh God, it hurt
[01:07.72] 天知道这有多难受 
[01:09.05]But I knew that it weren't right
[01:09.05] 但我明白那根本不对 
[01:13.25]Bet you would hate to think that that was true
